  "thig15.1:14.1": "<i lang='pi' translate='no'>Bhatti</i> “devotion” in this line is followed by <i lang='pi' translate='no'>anuratta</i> (“loyal”) in the next. The persistence of senses of these words is shown by their occurrence together in the much later Haribhaktikalpalatikā 1.10 (<i lang='pi' translate='no'>bhaktānuraktaṁ</i>). ",
