  "thig15.1:46.1": "",
  "thig15.1:46.2": "For <i lang='pi' translate='no'>pattayobbanaṁ</i> as “come of age”, i.e. old enough to have sex, see <a href='https://suttacentral.net/ja532/en/sujato#80.4'>Ja 532:80.4</a>. ",
  "thig15.1:46.3": "Like an ox in a pen (<a href='https://suttacentral.net/an6.60/en/sujato#3.1'>AN 6.60:3.1</a>). ",
